{"type":"message","id":"8346c9c7","parentId":"342edcc7","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:14:43.958Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nPerfect! Now let's summarize the changes we made:\n\n1. **引入依赖**: 新增了 `child_process` 模块的 `execSync` 方法，用于调用 docx-cn 转换工具\n2. **功能调整**:\n   - 原逻辑生成 MD + 纯文本TXT（伪装成Word），现在保留 MD 和 TXT 两种格式，新增 DOCX 格式输出\n   - 将原 `wordContent` 变量重命名为 `txtContent`，`docFile` 重命名为 `txtFile`，命名更准确\n   - 新增 DOCX 转换步骤，调用 `docx-cn` 技能，指定了中文常用字体（宋体/微软雅黑）、1.5倍行间距、自动生成目录，保证中文不会乱码，排版符合日常阅读习惯\n   - 增加了错误捕获，如果 DOCX 生成失败会给出警告，但不会中断整体流程，继续保留 TXT 作为替代\n3. **日志优化**:\n   - 更新了头部注释，说明现在生成3种格式\n   - 输出日志更清晰，分别标注 TXT 和 DOCX 生成步骤\n   - 最终摘要明确列出所有生成的文件路径，方便验证\n\nWait, also, let's check if the docx-cn skill is installed? Let's run a quick test to see if acpx can find it.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6scjbgfic3taa3dwjq243cu4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"acpx run skill docx-cn --help","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773429267615}}
